{"id":"847fd99f748e318f","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-measure7-conditional-entropy.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Conditional Entropy","display":"df-zfc-measure7-conditional-entropy — ZFC Measure7 Conditional Entropy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-conditional-entropy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-conditional-entropy"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-conditional-entropy — ZFC Measure7 Conditional Entropy","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-entropy]]","[[58-df-measure]]","[[58-df-probability]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-conditional-entropy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-conditional-entropy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-conditional-entropy — ZFC Measure7 Conditional Entropy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bc3b74121029112d\" href=\"?note=bc3b74121029112d\" title=\"58-df-entropy\">58-df-entropy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"58-df-probability\">58-df-probability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu\\)</span> (probability space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"58-df-probability\">58-df-probability</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_0,\\mathcal Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal P_0,\\mathcal Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\)</span> (finite measurable partitions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\)</span> (finite-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> (conditional entropy value, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bc3b74121029112d\" href=\"?note=bc3b74121029112d\" title=\"58-df-entropy\">58-df-entropy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ConditionalEntropy}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ConditionalEntropy}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}entropy} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ConditionalEntropy}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathcal P_0,\\mathcal Q,h)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathcal P_0,\\mathcal Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\mathcal P_0)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\mathcal Q)\\land\\forall P,P&#39;\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;(P\\neq P&#39;\\to P\\cap P&#39;=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall Q,Q&#39;\\in\\mathcal Q\\;(Q\\neq Q&#39;\\to Q\\cap Q&#39;=\\emptyset)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal P_0=X\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal Q=X\\land h=\\sum_{\\substack{Q\\in\\mathcal Q\\\\ \\mu(Q)&gt;0}}\\mu(Q)\\cdot\\left(-\\sum_{\\substack{P\\in\\mathcal P_0\\\\ \\mu(P\\cap Q)&gt;0}}\\frac{\\mu(P\\cap Q)}{\\mu(Q)}\\log\\left(\\frac{\\mu(P\\cap Q)}{\\mu(Q)}\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}entropy} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ConditionalEntropy}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathcal P_0,\\mathcal Q,h)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathcal P_0,\\mathcal Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\mathcal P_0)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\mathcal Q)\\land\\forall P,P&#39;\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;(P\\neq P&#39;\\to P\\cap P&#39;=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall Q,Q&#39;\\in\\mathcal Q\\;(Q\\neq Q&#39;\\to Q\\cap Q&#39;=\\emptyset)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal P_0=X\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal Q=X\\land h=\\sum_{\\substack{Q\\in\\mathcal Q\\\\ \\mu(Q)&gt;0}}\\mu(Q)\\cdot\\left(-\\sum_{\\substack{P\\in\\mathcal P_0\\\\ \\mu(P\\cap Q)&gt;0}}\\frac{\\mu(P\\cap Q)}{\\mu(Q)}\\log\\left(\\frac{\\mu(P\\cap Q)}{\\mu(Q)}\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The probability and finiteness guards now use predicates that actually exist in the cited atoms. Zero-probability cells contribute <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>, so no undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\log 0\">\\(0\\log 0\\)</span> term occurs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"bc3b74121029112d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-entropy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,\\mathcal A,\\mu$ (probability space, see [[58-df-probability]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S$ (probability-measure predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"bc3b74121029112d","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$h$ (conditional entropy value, see [[58-df-entropy]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_0,\\mathcal Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ConditionalEntropy}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}entropy} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7ConditionalEntropy}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathcal P_0,\\mathcal Q,h)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathcal P_0,\\mathcal Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\mathcal P_0)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\mathcal Q)\\land\\forall P,P'\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;(P\\neq P'\\to P\\cap P'=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall Q,Q'\\in\\mathcal Q\\;(Q\\neq Q'\\to Q\\cap Q'=\\emptyset)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal P_0=X\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal Q=X\\land h=\\sum_{\\substack{Q\\in\\mathcal Q\\\\ \\mu(Q)>0}}\\mu(Q)\\cdot\\left(-\\sum_{\\substack{P\\in\\mathcal P_0\\\\ \\mu(P\\cap Q)>0}}\\frac{\\mu(P\\cap Q)}{\\mu(Q)}\\log\\left(\\frac{\\mu(P\\cap Q)}{\\mu(Q)}\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"0\\log 0","display":false}],"bytes":1925,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2624","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-measure7-conditional-entropy.md|58-df-zfc-measure7-conditional-entropy]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","bc3b74121029112d","ca832ed6bc22f728","5e0db065132180df","0578a357a86e9d8f","07554a796c3aa1f5"]}